sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant Browser as Navigateur
    participant AdminUI as admin.html
    participant AuthEP as /api/admin-auth
    participant CabinetsEP as /api/cabinets
    participant Session as session.js
    participant GH as github.js
    participant GitHub as GitHub API
    participant Repo as fwBoa/CabinetsMAP

    rect rgba(220, 252, 231, 0.5)
        Note over Admin,Repo: Phase 1 - Authentification
        Admin->>Browser: Ouvre /admin.html
        Browser->>AdminUI: Charge la page
        AdminUI->>Browser: Affiche champ "Code d'accès"
        Admin->>Browser: Tape le code + Valide
        Browser->>AuthEP: POST { code: "..." }
        AuthEP->>AuthEP: hash(code) vs ADMIN_CODE_HASH
        alt Code invalide
            AuthEP-->>Browser: 401 Unauthorized
            Browser->>AdminUI: Affiche "Code incorrect"
        else Code valide
            AuthEP->>Session: sign({ user: "admin", exp })
            Session->>AuthEP: signedCookie
            AuthEP-->>Browser: 200 + Set-Cookie session=...
            Browser->>AdminUI: Passe a la liste
        end
    end

    rect rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.5)
        Note over Admin,Repo: Phase 2 - Chargement de la liste
        Browser->>CabinetsEP: GET /api/cabinets<br/>Cookie: session=...
        CabinetsEP->>Session: verify(cookie)
        Session-->>CabinetsEP: ok
        CabinetsEP->>GH: listCabinets()
        GH->>GitHub: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/cabinets.geojson
        GitHub-->>GH: { content: base64, sha, ... }
        GH-->>CabinetsEP: { features: [...], sha }
        CabinetsEP-->>Browser: 200 { cabinets, sha }
        Browser->>AdminUI: Render liste des 13 cabinets
    end

    rect rgba(254, 243, 199, 0.5)
        Note over Admin,Repo: Phase 3 - Edition d'un cabinet
        Admin->>Browser: Click "Modifier" sur cabinet X
        Browser->>AdminUI: Ouvre sheet formulaire<br/>pre-rempli avec X
        Admin->>Browser: Modifie telephone + Click "Enregistrer"
        Browser->>Browser: Validation cote client<br/>(nom non vide, email format)
        Browser->>CabinetsEP: POST { action: "edit",<br/>cabinet: {...}, sha }
        CabinetsEP->>Session: verify(cookie)
        CabinetsEP->>GH: editCabinet(action, cabinet, sha)
        GH->>GitHub: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/git/ref/heads/main
        GitHub-->>GH: { object: { sha: mainSha } }
        GH->>GitHub: POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/git/refs<br/>{ ref: "refs/heads/edit/cabinet-X-ts", sha: mainSha }
        GitHub-->>GH: 201 (branche creee)
        GH->>GitHub: PUT /repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/cabinets.geojson<br/>{ branch, sha, content: base64(newGeoJSON),<br/>message: "feat(cabinets): edit X - tel mis a jour" }
        GitHub-->>GH: 200 (commit cree)
        GH->>GitHub: POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls<br/>{ head: "edit/...", base: "main",<br/>title: "feat(cabinets): edit X", body: "..." }
        GitHub-->>GH: 201 { html_url: "https://github.com/fwBoa/.../pull/42" }
        GH-->>CabinetsEP: { prUrl, prNumber }
        CabinetsEP-->>Browser: 200 { prUrl: "..." }
        Browser->>AdminUI: Toast "PR creee"<br/>Lien cliquable vers GitHub
    end

    rect rgba(252, 165, 165, 0.3)
        Note over Admin,Repo: Phase 4 - Validation manuelle (hors-ligne du flux)
        Admin->>GitHub: Ouvre la PR, verifie le diff, clique "Merge"
        GitHub->>Repo: Merge feat/edit into main
        GitHub->>Vercel: Webhook push
        Vercel->>Vercel: Rebuild + redeploy
        Vercel-->>Repo: main mis a jour
    end

    Note over Browser,GitHub: Le visiteur public n'est jamais impacte pendant l'edition.<br/>Il voit la carte en lecture seule sur la version main pre-modification.
